OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Lincolnshire rider tackles
OL,4,ATour of Britain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincolnshire cyclist has taken to the
OL,7,Fcounty's roads to compete against
OL,8,Fseasoned pros in his first Tour of
OL,9,FBritain.
OL,11,FJacob Bush, 21, from Stamford, is
OL,12,Frepresenting the Great Britain Cycling
OL,13,FTeam in the 565-mile (910km) race,
OL,14,Fwhich started on Wednesday and included
OL,15,Fthe gruelling Michaelgate climb in
OL,16,FLincoln.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
