OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Lincolnshire rider tackles
OL,4,ATour of Britain
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a child, Bush tried several sports,
OL,7,Fincluding alpine skiing, but he decided
OL,8,Fto focus on road cycling after the
OL,9,Fpandemic. His achievements so far
OL,10,Finclude bagging a silver at the 2026
OL,11,FNational Criterium Championships.
OL,13,FSpeaking before the race, he said: "The
OL,14,Ffirst two stages of the race are the
OL,15,Fmost special to me, as both start in my
OL,16,Fhome county of Lincolnshire."
